            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Dental treatment rendered to patients suffering from various systemic problems may need to be varied from that normally given to healthy patients. This paper deals with these problems and recommends the precautionary measures that should be taken to avoid serious consequences.</AbstractText>
